meta {
  name: Login with GitHub
  type: http
  seq: 25
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/github
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "access_token": "{{githubAccessToken}}",
    "client_type": "mobile",
    "consents": [
      { "document_type": "terms", "document_version": "{{legal_terms_version}}" },
      { "document_type": "privacy", "document_version": "{{legal_privacy_version}}" }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  POST /api/v1/auth/github - access_token ATAU code+redirect_uri (+ code_verifier).

  consents OPSIONAL. Halaman Daftar mengirimnya (checkbox legal wajib);
  login page tidak. Akun baru tanpa consents: mode lenient = akun dibuat +
  backfill, response `requires_consent: true`; mode enforce = 400
  CONSENT_REQUIRED. Lihat docs/api/44-api-consent-oauth.md.
}
